use aws in eu-west-2

network is private and public
  cidr 10.20.0.0/16
  cidr 10.30.0.0/16
  size large

network is private

on aws
  network
    vpc vpc-1
    public_subnets subnet-a
    private_subnets subnet-c,subnet-d
    cidr 10.0.0.0/16
    vcp x
  network
    vpc vpc-2

on gcp
  network
    vpc x
